a discussion⟨48⟩ for direct support.\n  * 1. Dataset Overview⟨49⟩\n  * 2. Dataset Composition⟨50⟩\n    * 2.1 Imaging modes⟨51⟩\n    * 2.2 Typical scenes⟨52⟩\n    * 2.3 Data characteristics⟨53⟩\n  * 3. Application Scenarios⟨54⟩\n    * 4.1 Dataset Folder Structure⟨55⟩\n  * 4.2 Contents Summary⟨56⟩\n    * 4.3 Uploaded Sample Previews⟨57⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨58⟩ Video SAR - Optical Image Registration Dataset \n##   ⟨49⟩ 1. Dataset Overview \nThis dataset provides terahertz (THz) video SAR and optical image pairs with certain registration accuracy for cross-modal remote sensing research. It covers multiple typical scenes and SAR imaging modes, and can serve as benchmark data for heterogeneous image registration and matching algorithm validation.\n**Important Limitation Note** : The terahertz video Synthetic Aperture Radar observation data contained in this benchmark dataset are all acquired from airborne field imaging experiments. At present, the research on THz SAR-to-optical image registration is still in an immature stage. Combined with the restrictions brought by the unique physical imaging mechanism of the terahertz band, the original imaging quality and cross-modal registration accuracy of the dataset have objective inherent defects. Researchers can carry out targeted data modification, sample expansion and customized preprocessing based on this dataset to adapt to their differentiated research objectives and experimental schemes. \n##   ⟨50⟩ 2. Dataset Composition \n###   ⟨51⟩ 2.1 Imaging modes \nSpotlight mode and Stripmap mode\n###   ⟨52⟩ 2.2 Typical scenes \n  1. Airport (Spotlight)\n  2. Sundial (Spotlight)\n  3. Village (Stripmap)\n\n\n###   ⟨53⟩ 2.3 Data characteristics \nData form: Continuous video frame sequences with registration correspondence. Each scene contains hundreds of sequential frames, with thousands of valid registration pairs in total, supporting temporal stability analysis of registration algorithms.\n##   ⟨54⟩ 3. Application Scenarios \nThis dataset is applicable to research including:\n  * Cross-modal image registration and matching\n  * Multi-source remote sensing data fusion\n  * Video SAR target tracking\n  * Heterogeneous image feature extraction and alignment algorithm validation\n\n\n#   ⟨59⟩ 4. Dataset Structure & File Specification \n###   ⟨55⟩ 4.1 Dataset Folder Structure \nThe dataset is hierarchically organized by SAR acquisition mode, scene type, and cross-modal image modality. Each sample group contains a SAR patch, the matched optical patch, and an optional side-by-side comparison GIF animation.\n  * `Dataset/`\n    * `Spotlight_mode/`\n      * `Airport/`\n        * `Airport_paired_patches/`\n        * `Spotlight_mode_Airport_SAR/`\n        * `Spotlight_mode_Airport_Optical/`\n        * `Spotlight_mode_Airport_Compare/`\n        * `Spotlight_mode_Airport_Compare_Animation.gif`\n      * `Sundial/`\n        * `Sundial_paired_patches/`\n        * `Spotlight_mode_Sundial_SAR/`\n        * `Spotlight_mode_Sundial_Optical/`\n        * `Spotlight_mode_Sundial_Compare/`\n        * `Spotlight_mode_Sundial_Compare_Animation.gif`\n    * `Stripmap_mode/`\n      * `Village/`\n        * `Village_paired_patches/`\n        * `Stripmap_mode_Village_SAR/`\n        * `Stripmap_mode_Village_Optical/`\n        * `Stripmap_mode_Village_Compare/`\n        * `Stripmap_mode_Village_Compare_Animation.gif`\n\n\n##   ⟨56⟩ 4.2 Contents Summary   \n| Mode  | Scene  | Paired Samples  | SAR / Optical Patch Size  | Compare Image Size  | Index Range  |  \n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |  \n| Spotlight mode  | Airport  | 538  | 2048 × 2048  | 4096 × 2048  | 1–538  |  \n| Spotlight mode  | Sundial  | 312  | 2048 × 2048  | 4096 × 2048  | 001–312  |  \n| Stripmap mode  | Village  | 2,347  | 512 × 512  | 1024 × 512  | 00001–02347  |  \nThe full dataset contains 3,197 paired samples, stored as 9,591 PNG files plus 3 GIF animation files.\n###   ⟨57⟩ 4.3 Uploaded Sample Previews \nWe provide partial visual sample files in the repository root, while the full dataset is packaged in the compressed archive.\n  * Repository Root Files\n    * `Spotlight mode__Airport`\n      * `Spotlight mode__Airport__SAR__1.png`\n      * `Spotlight mode__Airport__Optical__1.png`\n      * `Spotlight mode__Airport__Compare__1.png`\n      * `Spotlight mode__Airport__Compare__Animation.gif`\n    * `Spotlight mode__Sundial`\n      * `Spotlight mode__Sundial__SAR__001.png`\n      * `Spotlight mode__Sundial__Optical__001.png`\n      * `Spotlight mode__Sundial__Compare__001.png`\n      * `Spotlight mode__Sundial__Compare__Animation.gif`\n    * `Stripmap mode__Village`\n      * `Stripmap mode__Village__SAR__00001.png`\n      * `Stripmap mode__Village__Optical__00001.png`\n      * `Stripmap mode__Village__Compare__00001.png`\n      * `Stripmap mode__Village__Compare__Animation.gif`\n  * Full Dataset Package\n    * `Terahertz Video SAR-Optical Cross-Modal Image Registration Dataset.zip`\n\n\n#   ⟨60⟩ Citations \n@misc{HuLi_THzVSAR_Optical_Reg_Dataset,\ntitle = {THz Video SAR - Optical Image Registration Dataset},\nauthor = {Hu, Li},\nyear = {2026},\nhowpublished = {\\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/Hu-Li-Comm/Terahertz-VSAR-Optical-Registration}}⟨61⟩,\nnote = {Apache-2.0}\n}\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    100\nNumber of rows: 9,606 Total file size: 34 GB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨62⟩ Privacy⟨63⟩ About⟨64⟩ Careers⟨65⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
